{
  "id": "NUM.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Wel 13",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova yero ni Musa, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or dhanu, kara gici gilib ng’om Kanan, m’amio ni nyithindho mir Israel: wuor ng’atu acel m’i kind suru pa weggi kubang’gi kubang’gi, kubang’gi kubang’gi ng’atuman ubed jaditmawijo m’i kindgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa orogi uai kud i langa mi Paran calku lembang’ola pa Yehova: gin ceke gi dhanu ma wi nyithindho mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nying’gi eni: Mi suru pa Ruben, Camua ma wod Zakur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Simeon, Cafat ma wod Hori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Yuda, Kaleb ma wod Yefune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Isakar, Igal ma wod Yusuf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Efraim, Hoceya ma wod Nun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Benyamin, Palti ma wod Rafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Zebulun, Gadiel ma wod Sodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Yusuf, (thelembene, mi suru pa Manase), Gadi ma wod Susi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Dan, Amiel ma wod Gemali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Acer, Sethur, ma wod Mikael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Naftali, Nabi ma wod Vofsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi suru pa Gad, Geuel ma wod Maki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi nying’ dhanu ma Musa orogi gici gilib ng’om. E Musa Lwong’o Hoceya ma wod Nun Yocuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa orogi gici gilib ng’om Kanan, man ewacu igi kumae, Wuidh malu i yo maeni yor ariwa ma piny, e wuidh i ng’om gudi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e wunen ng’om, maram ebedo ko; ku dhanu m’ubedo i ie, tek gi tek kadi ng’ic, tek gi nok kadi dupa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man maram ng’ombe bedo ko ma gibedo i ie, tek e ber kadi rac; man maram adhura ma gibedo i ie bedo ko, kadok kagonjo, kadi ka ma tek; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man maram ng’ombe bedo ko, tek etop kadi e tek, tek yen ni i ie, kadi umbe. Man wubed ku tegocwiny ma ber, e wukel kum nying yen m’i ng’ombe. Nie en e nindo mi landu mi mwoka mi nyingulok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno giidho malu, man gilibo ng’ombe ugambre i langa mi Zin cil kum Rehob, utundo ba kamondo mir Hamath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giidho malu yor ariwa ma piny, e gibino Hebron; man Ahiman, ku Cecai, man Talmai, ma gi nyithindho pa Anak, gini keca. (Nie jugomo Hebron rundi abiro ma fodi jukugomo Zoan i Misiri.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibino ba poga mi Eckol, man gitong’o jangulok acel ku kuca ku nzuru nyingulok acel i kume, e gitade ku yen giyeye ko gin ario; man gikelo kum nyingulemo bende, man kum nyingubolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakeca julwong’o poga mi Eckol, kum nzuru mi nyingulok ma nyithindho mir Israel utong’o ku kuca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gidwogo ma nwang’u ceng’ pier ang’wen uthum ma gidaru libo ko ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gicidho gibino ba Musa, man ba Harun, man bang’ udul ceke mi nyithindho mir Israel, ba langa mi Paran, ba Kadec; man gidwoko lembe i bang’gi, man bang’ udul ceke, e ginyutho igi nying’ piny m’i ng’ombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giyero ire, giwacu kumae, Watundo ba ng’om ka m’ioro ie wa; emolo cak ku kic andha; man maeni en e nying’ pinje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dhanu m’ubedo i ng’ombe gi tek, man gidwoko adhura tek, e gi dit apila: mange ke waneno nyithindho mir Anak kuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amalek ubedo i ng’om ma yor ariwa ma piny: man Jahiti, ku Jayebusi, man Jaamori, gibedo i ng’om gudi; man Jakanani bedo ceng’ni dhu nam, man i ng’et Yordan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Kaleb ujuko dhanu gi ling’ i wang’ Musa, man ewacu kumae, Wek waidhu kawono, man wagame iwa: kum wacopo sage andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dhanu ma giidho malu karacelo kude giwacu kumae, Wacopo idho malu wi dhanune ngo; kum gi tek ma sagu wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gikelo rwonglembe ma rac mi ng’om ma gilibo ni nyithindho mir Israel, giwacu kumae, Ng’om ma wakadhu kud i ie nilibe, en e ng’om ma camu ju m’ubedo i ie; man dhanu ceke ma waneno i ie gi dhanu ma boco dit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
